OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FSome patchy light rain in the
OL,6,Fsoutheast to start, but will clear
OL,7,Feast during the morning, with brighter
OL,8,Fskies developing by lunchtime. A
OL,9,Fscattering of showers then moving in
OL,10,Ffor the afternoon, some of which maybe
OL,11,Fheavy. Feeling cooler.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FShowers ease overnight, but
OL,14,Fsome continue in the northwest. Clear
OL,15,Fspells develop elsewhere. Winds also
OL,16,Fdie down into the early hours. Feeling
OL,17,Fcool overnight for many.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
