OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FAny showers in the
OL,6,Fnorthwest will clear through the
OL,7,Fmorning, leaving a mostly dry and
OL,8,Fbright day with sunny spells. Light
OL,9,Fwinds making it feel slightly warmer
OL,10,Fthan Tuesday.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,13,FStaying changeable through the week,
OL,14,Fas another band of rain moves in from
OL,15,Fthe west on Thursday, before drier and
OL,16,Fbrighter weather returns on Friday.
OL,17,FTemperatures likely around average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
